on","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest#built-with","README names model/tool roles; todo/codex-todo.md and todo/gemini-todo.md are separate development lanes. These are project records rather than a complete prompt transcript.",[571],{"_51":572,"_26":573,"_194":574},"Open the complete guild-game project","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest","Full Phaser campaign, fifteen minigame types, assets, native shells and tests. Install package dependencies, then npm run dev; the documented dev port is 3200. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","More ways to play",[578,579],"distribution",{"_51":583,"_26":584,"_194":585},{"_51":580,"_26":581,"_194":582},"GitHub Releases · iOS","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.7.3","Download — Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","GitHub Releases · Android","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.8.0","Download — Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.",[587],{"_51":588,"_26":557,"_194":589},"Play Clowder & Crest","Browser campaign with mouse/touch minigames. The title screen also offers a spoiler-marked unlocked minigame archive. Android/iOS packaging is included, but native installation has separate platform requirements. Initial asset loading can be slow.",[591],{"_51":592,"_26":568,"_194":-7},"Read the creator’s tool and code credits",[594,595,596,597],"Start a guild and complete an opening job.","Read the tool credits and separate coding lanes.","Inspect one minigame and its dedicated playtest.","Change one job mechanic and check campaign progression and saves.","JacobStephens2 identifies Claude Code as the primary coding and design partner, Codex CLI as a second coding lane, and Gemini CLI as a third. PixelLab, Midjourney, ElevenLabs and Suno supplied different asset types; the repository contains per-agent task files.",[594,595,596,597],{"_51":592,"_26":568,"_18":214},{"_51":588,"_26":557,"_18":204,"_194":589},{"_51":572,"_26":573,"_247":248,"_194":574},{"_51":567,"_26":568,"_194":569},[246,117,611],[606,607],{"_608":583,"_26":584,"_18":502,"_194":610},{"_608":580,"_26":581,"_18":502,"_194":609},"platform","Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.","gemini-cli","example:silent-meridian-codex","silent-meridian-codex","Silent Meridian","Investigate an observatory trapped at 00:17, compare Present and Echo states, and solve thirteen connected puzzles across four chapters with a journal and optional hints.","/examples/silent-meridian-codex/",{"_20":613,"_22":614,"_24":615,"_107":679,"_89":237,"_233":238,"_230":678,"_9":680,"_215":681,"_19":682,"_33":683,"_190":684,"_181":685},[619,620,621,622,623,624,625,626,627,628,629,630,631,632,633,634,635,636,637,638],{"_49":22,"_53":614,"_55":22,"_57":-7},{"_49":111,"_53":615,"_55":24,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":235,"_53":679,"_55":107,"_57":58},{"_49":50,"_51":87,"_53":234,"_55":89,"_57":90},{"_49":50,"_51":231,"_53":232,"_55":233,"_57":86},{"_49":50,"_51":228,"_53":678,"_55":230,"_57":58},{"_49":173,"_51":221,"_222":223,"_61":673,"_55":9,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":216,"_61":670,"_55":215,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":213,"_53":301,"_55":215,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":211,"_53":212,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":205,"_61":665,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":203,"_53":204,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":198,"_61":660,"_55":33,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":196,"_53":197,"_55":33,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":188,"_61":655,"_55":190,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":179,"_61":65