See android/README.md for Android builds.",[995,996],{"_51":1000,"_26":979,"_194":1001},{"_51":997,"_26":998,"_194":999},"GitHub Releases","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain/releases/tag/v1.5.3","Download — Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","GitHub Pages","Browser play — Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.",[1003],{"_51":1004,"_26":987,"_194":1005},"Play Word Rain on itch.io","Free browser game with keyboard, drag and touch controls; an alternative browser build is linked on GitHub Pages. The store and GitHub Releases also offer Full/Lite Android APKs and an offline Lite HTML ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Browser start, moving letters and basket controls were checked; APK installation and a complete scoring run were not tested.","itch.io","quickstart",[1009],{"_51":1010,"_26":1011,"_194":-7},"Read the creator’s source and run guide","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain#run-the-game",[1013,1014,1015,1016],"Start the browser game and move the basket with the arrow keys, A/D or pointer dragging.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure and compare the browser and Android editions.","Open index.html with the bundled assets/music directory, or use the self-contained Lite download for offline browser play.","Trace letter spawning, catches, shields and score updates in the Canvas game; check pause and resume before changing a rule.","octopuskid designed and refined the game, while ChatGPT/Codex assisted with code and interface text. The original tune and sound effects are synthesized in code with ChatGPT assistance. Two optional Kevin MacLeod recordings have separate credits; they are not AI-generated music.","Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM/CSS UI",[1013,1014,1015,1016],{"_51":1010,"_26":1011,"_18":1007},{"_51":1004,"_26":987,"_18":204,"_194":1005},{"_51":991,"_26":992,"_247":248,"_194":993},{"_51":986,"_26":987,"_194":988},[117],[1026,1027],{"_608":1000,"_26":979,"_18":204,"_194":1029},{"_608":997,"_26":998,"_18":502,"_194":1028},"Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.","example:overexposed-ai","overexposed-ai","Overexposed","Guide a rising performer through a year of career choices in a card-based fame simulation. Play cards to build craft, money and attention while three newspapers react and excessive heat turns into scandals.","/examples/overexposed-ai/",{"_20":1031,"_22":1032,"_24":1033,"_107":1094,"_89":237,"_233":238,"_230":1091,"_9":1095,"_215":1096,"_19":1097,"_33":1098,"_190":1099,"_181":1100,"_448":1101},[1037,1038,1039,1040,1041,1042,1043,1044,1045,1046,1047,1048,1049,1050,1051,1052,1053,1054,1055,1056,1057],{"_49":22,"_53":1032,"_55":22,"_57":-7},{"_49":111,"_53":1033,"_55":24,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":235,"_53":1094,"_55":107,"_57":58},{"_49":173,"_51":445,"_222":446,"_61":1092,"_55":448,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":87,"_53":234,"_55":89,"_57":90},{"_49":50,"_51":231,"_53":232,"_55":233,"_57":86},{"_49":50,"_51":228,"_53":1091,"_55":230,"_57":58},{"_49":173,"_51":221,"_222":223,"_61":1086,"_55":9,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":216,"_61":1082,"_55":215,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":213,"_53":1007,"_55":215,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":211,"_53":1006,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":205,"_61":1078,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":203,"_53":204,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":198,"_61":1073,"_55":33,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":196,"_53":197,"_55":33,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":188,"_61":1069,"_55":190,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":179,"_61":1066,"_55":181,"_57":-7},{"_49":173,"_55":174,"_51":175,"_61":1065},{"_49":163,"_55":115,"_51":1061,"_72":1062,"_82":1063,"_33":1064,"_168":169,"_170":171,"_56":651},{"_49":50,"_55":644,"_51":645,"_53":646},{"_49":59,"_55":639,"_51":640,"_61":1058},[1059],{"_51":640,"_26":1060},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTA3MzQwMi8zMTAxNTIwOS5wbmc=/original/pgaZBa.png","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io game page.","/GameMap/media/learning/overexposed-ai.webp","Overexposed’s desktop card table with newspapers, career cards, money, fame, craft, heat and an End Turn control.","https://eg30.itch.io/overexposed",[178,177],[1067,1068],{"_51":178,"_26":187},{"_51":95,"_26":96},[1070],{"_51":1071,"_26":1064,"_194":1072},"Read the creator’s AI contribution and asset disclosure","The author names Claude Code and OpenAI Codex and explains human editing of text. README confirms AI-assisted commits with Co-Authored-By trailers; CREDITS.md explains procedural pictures/effects and the separate music/font sources.",[1074],{"_51":1075,"_26":1076,"_194":1077},"Open the complete career-simulation project","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed","Complete TypeScript/React project with the rule engine, content, UI drawings, procedural sound, six music files, fonts, balance simulator and browser checks. Node.js >=22.18; npm install, npm run dev or npm run build. No explicit software license is provided, so public source availability does not establish reuse rights. Bundled fonts are OFL 1.1 and Holizna music is CC0; see CREDITS.md.",[1079],{"_51":1080,"_26":1064,"_194":1081},"Play Overexposed on itch.io","Browser playtest build, best on a landscape desktop screen. Uses mouse or touch; cards show effects on hover or long press. Begin, opening text and manager choice reached the live card desk in Chrome. The complete year, all endings and touch play were not tested; the hosted build is not claimed to match the latest repository revision.",[1083],{"_51":1084,"_26":1085,"_194":-7},"Read the game’s source and local run commands","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed#readme",[1087,1088,1089,1090],"Open the itch.io browser build, choose Begin and Continue, then sign with a manager.","Select an opening card offer and inspect how the desk, resources and newspapers respond.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure, README and CREDITS.md to separate code-generated art and effects from third-party music.","Use Node.js 22.18+ with npm install and npm run dev; trace content/cards.json through core/reducer.ts and the React desk before testing a complete year.","EG30 provides design, direction and writing, using Claude Code and OpenAI Codex for implementation. AI-assisted drafts of player text are edited by the creator. Art and sound effects are drawn or synthesized in code with AI assistance; the Holizna background recordings are separately credited CC0 music.",[1093],"Canvas 2D (procedural halftone art)","DOM/CSS + SVG · React UI",[1087,1088,1089,1090],{"_51":1084,"_26":1085,"_18":1007},{"_51":1080,"_26":1064,"_18":204,"_194":1081},{"_51":1075,"_26":1076,"_247":248,"_194":1077},{"_51":1071,"_26":1064,"_194":1072},[245,117],[1093],"resource:codex","resource","A general-purpose coding agent for reading, editing, running commands, and reviewing code in a local repository.","/resources/",{"_20":117,"_1168":95,"_233":1169,"_49":1170,"_1167":1104,"_1162":1161,"_26":1159,"_59":1171,"_1146":1172,"_1139":1173,"_1135":1174,"_1132":275},[1109,1110,1111,1112,1113,1114,1115,1116,1117,1118,1119,1120,1121],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_49":22,"_53":95,"_55":1168,"_57":-7},{"_49":111,"_53":1104,"_55":1167,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":1165,"_53":1166,"_55":233,"_57":90},{"_49":50,"_51":1163,"_53":1164,"_55":49,"_57":90},{"_49":50,"_51":1160,"_53":1161,"_55":1162,"_57":58},{"_49":59,"_51":198,"_61":1157,"_55":26,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":1152,"_61":1153,"_55":59,"_57":-7},{"_49":173,"_51":1144,"_222":446,"_61":1145,"_55":1146,"_57":-7},{"_49":173,"_51":1137,"_222":446,"_61":1138,"_55":1139,"_57":-7},{"_49":173,"_51":1133,"_222":446,"_61":1134,"_55":1135,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":1131,"_53":275,"_55":1132,"_57":90},{"_49":50,"_55":1128,"_51":1129,"_53":1130},{"_49":59,"_55":1122,"_51":1123,"_61":1124},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[1125],{"_51":1126,"_26":1127},"OpenAI","https://github.com/openai/codex","identity","Identity & attribution","Official OpenAI coding agent and OpenAI-authored workflow. Use the OpenAI brand mark, not a generated substitute.","Source reviewed","verified","Tracks",[234,88,1136],"dimensions","World models","Development stages",[1140,1141,1142,1143],"stages","Planning","Gameplay & code","Testing","Build & release","Topics",[1147,1148,1149,1150,1151],"tags","CLI","General-purpose agent","Code review","MCP","Skills","Further reading",[1154],{"_51":1155,"_26":1156},"Official game workflow","https://learn.chatgpt.com/use-cases/browser-games",[1158],{"_51":198,"_26":1159},"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli","Why it belongs here","Useful as the main code execution loop for a game project: break down gameplay, maintain scripts, run builds, and inspect failures. Engine integration still requires a CLI, editor bridge, or MCP server; compiling successfully does not establish that a game is playable.","detail","Resource type","Agent","Category","Coding agents","summary","name","agents","agent",[1180],[1147,1148,1149,1150,1151],[1176,1177,1178,1179],[237,112,1175],"world","plan","code","test","ship",{"_51":1155,"_26":1156},{"_1182":1183},"documents",{"_1184":1185,"_1186":1187},"en",[1189,1193,1194,1195,1192,1196,1197,1198,1199,1200,1201,1202,1203,1204,1205,1206,1207,1208,1209,1210,1211,1212,1213,1214,1215,1216,1217,1218,1219,1220,1221,1222,1223,1224,1225,1226,1227,1191,1228,1190,1229,1230,1231,1232,1233,1234,1235,1236,1237,1238,1239,1240,1241,1242,1243,1244,1245,1246,1247,1248,1249],"zh",[1188,1189,1190,1191,1192],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishi